[statement]
Requested packages are walked in the order of their names, for decisions as
for install order: `b`, sorting first though requested second, reaches
`y`, whose single provider `p2` also provides `x`, before `z` reaches
`x`.

[repository]
P:p1
V:1.0-r0
p:x
k:100

P:p2
V:1.0-r0
p:x y=1
k:10

P:z
V:1
D:x

P:b
V:1
D:y

[request]
z
b

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install p2 1.0-r0
install b 1
install z 1
